{"id": "united-council-westbrook", "title": "Ex-CEO of Bayview homeless nonprofit charged with taking $1.2M", "seconds": 160.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "97c34986b0ea160f", "words": 404, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "In the Bayview, United Council of Human Services ran housing for homeless people.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.69, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Bayview Hunters Point", "hoodLabel": "Bayview", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.4, "kicker": "United Council of Human Services"}, "wt": [0.02, 0.05, 0.19, 1.02, 1.35, 1.75, 1.88, 2.17, 2.75, 2.97, 3.47, 3.62, 4.02]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "oneLine"], "text": "In February 2026, prosecutors charged its former head, Gwendolyn Westbrook.", "t0": 4.81, "t1": 9.7, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The charges", "sub": "filed Feb 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.46, 0.72, 1.8, 2.33, 2.65, 2.8, 3.15, 3.85, 4.27]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "oneLine"], "text": "How much do they say she took?", "t0": 9.82, "t1": 10.97, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The charges", "sub": "filed Feb 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.02, 0.2, 0.27, 0.41, 0.56, 0.76]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[8]"], "text": "More than 1.2 million dollars.", "t0": 10.97, "t1": 13.74, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.2 million", "label": "alleged, 2019 to 2023"}, "emph": ["More"], "wt": [0.04, 0.67, 0.86, 1.03, 1.39, 1.56, 2.09]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction.", "t0": 14.26, "t1": 16.82, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.52, 0.63, 0.75, 1.65, 1.78, 1.87]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "First, the money. The City didn’t pay this group directly.", "t0": 17.04, "t1": 20.15, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "grants"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Fiscal sponsor", "sub": "a bigger nonprofit, holds the money"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "UCHS", "sub": "runs the services"}], "kicker": "How the money moved"}, "wt": [0.26, 0.56, 0.71, 1.15, 1.36, 1.56, 1.84, 2.03, 2.23, 2.51]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "It paid a bigger nonprofit, a fiscal sponsor.", "t0": 20.27, "t1": 22.81, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "grants"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Fiscal sponsor", "sub": "a bigger nonprofit, holds the money"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "UCHS", "sub": "runs the services"}], "kicker": "How the money moved"}, "emph": ["fiscal sponsor"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.24, 0.35, 0.63, 1.48, 1.57, 1.97]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "In November 2022, the City’s auditor, the Controller, checked six grants. How much were they?", "t0": 22.93, "t1": 29.64, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "The Controller’s audit", "sub": "November 2022, six grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.59, 1.02, 2.0, 2.12, 2.5, 3.14, 3.24, 4.16, 4.52, 4.79, 5.57, 5.96, 6.16, 6.36]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "36.4 million dollars.", "t0": 29.64, "t1": 33.16, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$36.4 million", "label": "in grant ceilings", "sub": "nearly $28 million budgeted for UCHS"}, "emph": ["36.4"], "wt": [0.04, 1.34, 1.73, 2.04, 2.76]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Nearly 28 million of it was set aside for this group.", "t0": 33.68, "t1": 36.72, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$28 million", "label": "budgeted for UCHS"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.68, 1.02, 1.15, 1.29, 1.49, 1.71, 2.07, 2.21, 2.45]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "established[1]"], "text": "The sponsor said the group hid its bank statements. After eight months, it asked to quit.", "t0": 36.84, "t1": 41.21, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "not given full access to key records, such as bank statements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.52, 0.7, 0.79, 1.07, 1.25, 1.4, 1.66, 2.34, 2.74, 2.96, 3.49, 3.62, 3.86, 3.97]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[1]", "established[7]"], "text": "Its fourth sponsor since 2009.", "t0": 41.33, "t1": 44.1, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Four sponsors", "sub": "three since 2009, Felton Institute the fourth in October 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.57, 1.2, 1.73, 1.87, 2.26]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[1]", "established[7]"], "text": "A 2017 audit found similar problems, and the Controller closed this one’s fixes in April 2024.", "t0": 44.22, "t1": 50.93, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Four sponsors", "sub": "three since 2009, Felton Institute the fourth in October 2022"}, "emph": ["2017"], "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.28, 0.75, 1.07, 1.35, 1.76, 2.71, 2.78, 2.87, 3.28, 3.59, 3.75, 4.07, 4.74, 5.04, 5.5, 5.94]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]"], "text": "One more record: the state revoked the group’s charity registration in September 2023.", "t0": 51.05, "t1": 57.47, "shot": "b10b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Charity registration revoked", "kicker": "The state registry", "sub": "09/18/2023, after more than a year suspended"}, "emph": ["revoked"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.42, 1.22, 1.56, 1.95, 2.39, 2.54, 2.87, 3.21, 4.03, 4.47, 5.0, 5.66]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]", "notEstablished[6]"], "text": "Its reports for 2021, 2022 and 2023 were not filed.", "t0": 57.59, "t1": 62.91, "shot": "b10b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Charity registration revoked", "kicker": "The state registry", "sub": "reports for 2021, 2022 and 2023 not filed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.47, 0.61, 0.87, 1.67, 1.87, 2.72, 3.0, 3.21, 3.9, 4.49, 4.73]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]", "notEstablished[6]"], "text": "Did its sponsors know?", "t0": 63.03, "t1": 64.2, "shot": "b10b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Charity registration revoked", "kicker": "The state registry", "sub": "reports for 2021, 2022 and 2023 not filed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.25, 0.72]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[12]"], "text": "Its 2020 tax return says a single audit was done.", "t0": 64.2, "t1": 67.89, "shot": "b10c", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "x21a", "kicker": "Form 990 for 2020, Part XII", "text": "a federal single audit was required and done; the statements were not audited", "mark": "single audit"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.73, 1.0, 1.31, 1.61, 2.01, 2.26, 2.34, 2.68, 2.99, 3.16]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[12]", "notEstablished[8]"], "text": "The same return says it was not audited. None is on file.", "t0": 68.01, "t1": 72.15, "shot": "b10d", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Federal audit clearinghouse", "sub": "no audit of it on file for any year since 2016", "text": "says a federal single audit was required and done, and in the same part says its statements were not audited", "mark": "required and done"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.91, 1.09, 1.17, 1.32, 1.53, 2.25, 3.13, 3.44, 3.63]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "First finding: the City ranks who needs housing most.", "t0": 72.37, "t1": 75.62, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Who got the rooms?", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.16, 0.24, 0.74, 0.93, 1.22, 1.68, 1.93, 2.27, 2.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "Of 29 tenants checked, how many skipped that, or lacked papers?", "t0": 75.74, "t1": 80.2, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Who got the rooms?", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.72, 1.24, 2.07, 2.17, 2.44, 2.83, 3.21, 3.31, 3.72]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "24.", "t0": 80.2, "t1": 81.44, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "24", "label": "of 29 sampled tenants", "sub": "83%, and 19 had incomes figured wrong"}, "emph": ["24"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "That’s 83 percent. 19 had incomes figured wrong.", "t0": 81.56, "t1": 86.02, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "may be ineligible"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.87, 2.19, 2.67, 2.93, 3.46, 3.92]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "They may be ineligible, the audit says.", "t0": 86.14, "t1": 88.05, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "may be ineligible"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.28, 0.42, 1.18, 1.28, 1.57]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "Second: three of the group’s own employees got housing, skipping that system.", "t0": 88.27, "t1": 93.02, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Hope House Consolidated", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "three employees enrolled"}, "emph": ["three"], "wt": [0.37, 0.68, 1.03, 1.13, 1.22, 1.63, 1.86, 2.57, 2.77, 3.57, 4.02, 4.24]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "Third: the sponsor was supposed to collect rent. The group did instead. How much?", "t0": 93.24, "t1": 98.78, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Tenants", "sub": "pay rent"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "UCHS", "sub": "collected it instead"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Fiscal sponsor", "sub": "supposed to collect it"}], "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 1.01, 1.39, 1.52, 1.78, 1.87, 2.24, 2.89, 3.16, 3.59, 3.95, 4.52, 4.89]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "At least 108,861 dollars.", "t0": 98.78, "t1": 102.58, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$108,861", "label": "in rent, March to August 2022", "sub": "at least $30,661 not handed over"}, "emph": ["At"], "wt": [0.04, 0.4, 0.67, 0.86, 1.18, 1.4, 1.87, 2.19, 2.55, 3.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "At least 30,661 was never handed over.", "t0": 102.7, "t1": 107.11, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30,661", "label": "never handed over"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.58, 0.93, 1.5, 1.63, 1.93, 2.78, 3.18, 3.46, 3.85]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "So the rent went around the sponsor.", "t0": 107.11, "t1": 109.76, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30,661", "label": "never handed over"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.68, 0.84, 1.33, 1.63, 1.88, 2.0]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "Now the charges.", "t0": 109.98, "t1": 111.01, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The criminal case", "kicker": "The charges", "sub": "2019 to 2023"}, "wt": [0.11, 0.17, 0.35]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "From 2019 to 2023, prosecutors say, she moved money to herself,", "t0": 111.13, "t1": 116.26, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The criminal case", "kicker": "The charges", "sub": "2019 to 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.88, 1.18, 1.39, 2.33, 2.93, 3.66, 3.85, 4.07, 4.37, 4.48]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[8]"], "text": "in cash and self-paid checks, with no records.", "t0": 116.26, "t1": 119.68, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The criminal case", "kicker": "The charges", "sub": "2019 to 2023"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.65, 1.0, 1.48, 2.07, 2.62, 2.81]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[8]"], "text": "Also, stealing 91,000 dollars, and four false state tax returns. Nine felonies in all.", "t0": 119.8, "t1": 126.15, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["theft count", "$91,000"], "b": ["false state tax returns", "2020 to 2023"]}, "emph": ["91,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.71, 1.12, 1.61, 2.31, 2.66, 2.93, 3.26, 3.61, 3.87, 4.59, 5.39, 5.85, 6.01]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[9]"], "text": "The charges were announced in February 2026, with no purchases described.", "t0": 126.27, "t1": 131.15, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "diverted public funds for personal use"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.65, 1.09, 1.19, 1.71, 2.04, 3.16, 3.36, 3.59, 4.13]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "The records don’t show either sponsor knew.", "t0": 131.37, "t1": 133.77, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That either sponsor knew of the withdrawals", "Who the sponsor was from 2019 to January 2022"]}, "wt": [0.01, 0.07, 0.46, 0.7, 1.08, 1.48, 1.96]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Or who the sponsor was", "t0": 133.89, "t1": 135.21, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["